      <activity id="3b8b7a28-d479-5132-8e79-e5023cd37d5e" activityNameId="2f2a59ab-33eb-5084-8eb7-169d52ed1b17" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 0ffd415a-8d24-4d5f-a8a8-f02ec67101d5
This process models 1 meter of sewer system  infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe, DN 800, profile 2A, according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with polymer concrete pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 800, profile 2A according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymer concrete pipe, ID 800 mm, outer diameter 948 mm, wall thickness 74 mm, 476 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³. A1-A5 and C1-C4
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0ffd415a-8d24-4d5f-a8a8-f02ec67101d5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
